;;; An obligation a node is told about that root was not — **W26**,
;;; register row `W26/oblig-derived-activator` (`corpus/wrong_answers.toml`;
;;; Q-M1e.11). Its control is `oblig-derived-activator-declared.ein`, which
;;; states the activator.
;;;
;;; ── What this program is ───────────────────────────────────────────────
;;;
;;; `std.algebra`'s `total-owed` over `likes`, stated, and over `drinks`,
;;; whose activator `(total-owed drinks is-a)` the rule `arm` derives from any
;;; `likes` fact: an obligation's activator that only a commitment derives.
;;;
;;; ── The answer, by hand ────────────────────────────────────────────────
;;;
;;; Ann owes a Food and, once she likes one, a Drink. `{(likes Ann Soup),
;;; (drinks Ann Tea)}` pays both debts, so R holds it, as the control's R is
;;; that one state.
;;;
;;; ── What the engine answers ────────────────────────────────────────────
;;;
;;; The by-hand answer (Q-M1e.11, by the static
;;; reading): the obligations rung reads the activator
;;; off `arm`'s `:assert` and proposes at root what the debt it brings would,
;;; so H is `{(drinks Ann Tea), (likes Ann Soup)}`, the read-out's
;;; `later debt` row says which candidate is there for which activator, and R
;;; is the one state that holds both. The static check flags the program
;;; (`total-owed`'s activator relation is one a commitment can change), so
;;; the cube answers it.
;;;
;;; At `94c75204` (`ein solve FILE` and `ein oracle FILE`, release and debug
;;; alike) the rung built H from the debts root owes alone: H was
;;; `{(likes Ann Soup)}`, the one node that holds it owed `drinks`, and R was
;;; empty, every alive node owing.
;;;
;;;

(import std.algebra :symbols (total-owed))
(relation is-a   T T :why "{?1} is a {?2}")
(relation likes  Person Food :why "{?1} likes {?2}")
(relation drinks Person Drink :why "{?1} drinks {?2}")
(is-a Ann Person) (is-a Soup Food) (is-a Tea Drink)
(total-owed likes is-a)
(rule arm () :match (likes ?p ?f) :assert (total-owed drinks is-a) :why "{?p} likes {?f}, which switches on the debt that every Person drinks a Drink")
(solve :no-hypothesis (is-a))
